# The Trespasser's rings (Rerac-vr's): plugged in as socket.sim. From 0.1.21 (puzzle.h) each push of a stick is one step of
# the chosen ring, the push's first way kept until let go; held to the side, a step again after 0.45 s, then four a
# second; up and down choose the ring, one a push; A a step clockwise, B anticlockwise, X the next ring round; a fresh
# pull of the trigger withdraws. "[vr-puzzle]" lines say what was asked and what the lock did. Ring 1 is the outer.
