# The grab (Grab the Trespasser's rings): the left hand over the middle ring's right (85% of the way from the eyes to
# the panel), the grip closed: it takes the middle ring; taken round clockwise, down, past a quarter: three steps on
# it; let go. Then over the outer ring's top, round anticlockwise a quarter: at least two steps back (the panel
# is a little off the place this was worked out for, so a grab's first angle is a few degrees off).
